    <string name="user_data_policy">Bu ilova foydalanuvchi ma\'lumotlarini yig\'maydi</string>
    <string name="setup_desc">"Davom etishdan oldin, ilovaning barcha funksiyalari ishlashini ta'minlash uchun zarur amallarni bajarish tavsiya etiladi."</string>
    <string name="discord_setup_title">Boshlashdan oldin</string>
    <string name="discord_setup_desc">Discord faoliyatingizning profilingizda ko\'rinishiga ruxsat berishini tekshiring.</string>
    <string name="discord_step1_title">1-qadam: Maxfiylik sozlamalarini ochish</string>
    <string name="discord_step1_content">Discord ilovasini oching → o\'zingizning (profil rasm) ikonkasini bosing → Sozlamalar (⚙️) ni bosing → pastga aylantiring va "Mazmun va ijtimoiy tarmoqlar" (yoki eski versiyalarda "Faoliyat maxfiyligi") bo\'limini bosing.</string>
    <string name="discord_step2_title">2-qadam: Faoliyat ulashishni yoqish</string>
    <string name="discord_step2_content">"Faoliyatimni ulashish" ni topib yoqing. "Faoliyatimni qayerda ulashaman" ostidan "Barcha serverlarda ulashish" ni tanlang. "Mening serverlarim" gacha aylantirib, holatingiz ko\'rinishini xohlagan serverlarni yoqing.</string>
    <string name="discord_step3_title">3-qadam: Onlayn holatingizni tekshiring</string>
    <string name="discord_step3_content">Holatingizni bosing (foydalanuvchi nomingiz ostida) va Onlayn, Bekor qilmaydi yoki Bezovta qiling\' deb tanlang. ⚠️ Ko\'rinmaydigan holatdan foydalanmang — ko\'rinmaganda Discord Kizzy faolligini yashiradi.</string>
    <string name="discord_tip_title">"Faoliyatimni ulashish" topilmadimi?</string>
    <string name="discord_tip_content">Discordning ba\'zi mobil versiyalari bu tugmani yashiradi. Chrome\'da discord.com ni oching → Desktop saytni yoqing → tizimga kiring → Sozlamalar (⚙️) → Faoliyat maxfiyligi → "Faoliyatimni ulashish" ni yoqing.</string>
